1,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I want to make sure our new service is truly reliable for everyone, regardless of the season or location. Shall we begin?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to meet you all as well. I agree with Shizue; accessibility is key. I look forward to seeing which data points will help us ensure the service reaches those who need it most.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi! I'm so excited to help! I think we should look at things we've already tried before so we don't just guess. Let's find out what actually happened in the past!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a bit of historical context would be most illuminating. I believe we should be equally mindful of the structural sustainability of whatever we choose to implement. I look forward to your suggestions.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree. To ensure sustainability, we must verify that we have the necessary capacity and expertise to manage these services without overextending our current staff. Let us consider which data points will reveal our actual operational limits.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I think it would be wise to check the winter road closures north of the river and the bus links in the two outer wards. We must ensure our services remain steady even when the weather turns.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we should examine the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use. Understanding how people currently access us is essential for any expansion.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to see the attendance sheets from former outreach stops and those two programmes begun six years ago! If we did them before, we should know if they were actually fun and worked!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall examine the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year. It would be a pity to build a house on a foundation of sand.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I will look into the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. We need to know if the required skills and oversight are actually available to us.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a very thorough plan. I am glad to see we are considering everything from the budget to the volunteers. I feel quite comfortable with the choices we have made.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. By covering both the physical access and the digital usage patterns, we can see the full picture of our reach. I believe this balanced approach will serve us well.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I hope the old records tell us something cool! It's like a treasure hunt for ideas. I can't wait to see if the people liked the old programmes or if they were boring!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A treasure hunt indeed, Rin. Though I suspect the ""treasure"" may be more in the form of spreadsheets than gold. Still, a bit of curiosity is a wonderful catalyst for a productive meeting.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"It is important that we remain focused on the practicalities. While curiosity is helpful, our priority must be the feasibility of implementation. I look forward to seeing if our current resources match our ambitions.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Minako. Practicality is a kindness to those who will eventually run the service. I look forward to hearing what you all discover. Let us proceed with our research.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I concur. Let us take this time to reflect on the data and return with a clearer understanding of how we can best serve our community. I look forward to our next discussion.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to go find those old papers right now! See you all soon with the secrets from the past! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Until then. I shall endeavor to find some clarity within the financial archives. I wish you all a most fruitful investigation. See you in the next round.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us gather the facts and return. I will focus on whether we have the actual human capacity to support these expansions. See you all soon.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
